# With the reference index set to 2.5 the mode gathers phase quickly in the envelope, and the step size shows: the Crank-Nicolson step is second order.
# Reference: the phase per step t becomes 2 atan(t / 2). The pipeline compares each field with the solution that needs no stepping.
title Guide with a poor reference index, 1 um steps
grid dx=0.02 dz=1
reference 2.5
window width=12 length=20
guide straight x=0 width=0.5 from=0 to=20
launch mode x=0 width=0.5
monitor out z=20 x=0 width=0.5
expect power out 0.999998868 2e-7
expect neff 2.629272275 2e-8
expect neff 2.62927228 2e-6
expect power_above out 0.9995
